 nfirm the Transistor scheduled-publish fired.\n- Send the guest their cl
 ips.\n- Buffer rule: never publish below a 1-episode buffer (a buffer is
  at least one edited\, unreleased episode held in reserve). If it hits z
 ero\, pause the streak by design with a pre-written note\; do not ship u
 nedited.\n\nRIGHT LOOKS LIKE\n- Episode live\; QA gate passed\; guest se
 nt their clips\; buffer >= 1 maintained (or streak paused on purpose).\n
